==Polish==

===Etymology===
{{unk|pl}}. Possible etymologies include:
* From the surname ''Łodzic''.
* From the given name {{m|pl|Włodzisław}}.
* From {{etyl|zlw-opl|pl}} {{m|zlw-opl|łoza||willow tree}}.
Popular '''incorrect''' etymologies include:
* From {{m|pl|łódź||boat}}. This is incorrect, since the city does not lie near any [[navigable]] body of water.
* From {{m|pl|Łódka}}, a small river in the city. This is also incorrect, since the river was named after the city, not the other way around.

